OL,3,GNEWSADress made for turn of the century
OL,4,Agoes on display
OL,5,
OL,6,FNicola Heald, from the trust, said the
OL,7,Fdress would only be exhibited between
OL,8,F28 August to 27 September "because the
OL,9,Ffabric is so sensitive to light" and
OL,10,Fthe display was a "rare chance" to see
OL,11,Fit.
